WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:05.662
Hi! Next week is very busy. Let's look at my diary!

2
00:00:07.112 --> 00:00:10.409
On Monday at nine, I'm seeing the dentist.

3
00:00:10.859 --> 00:00:12.531
I have an appointment.

4
00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:18.868
On Tuesday, I'm meeting my new boss at ten o'clock.

5
00:00:21.118 --> 00:00:25.762
On Wednesday evening, I'm taking a yoga class with my sister.

6
00:00:28.012 --> 00:00:32.238
On Friday, I'm flying to Rio. I have the tickets!

7
00:00:34.488 --> 00:00:40.061
Why? Because on Saturday, my best friend is getting married!

8
00:00:40.511 --> 00:00:43.343
And you? What are you doing next weekend?

